{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792221360, "covers_from": "2026-10-17T07:16:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-17T07:17:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792221420, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-17T07:16:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31345, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "北投行義路哪裡，公車司機在開車的時候速度都太快。尤其在山坡上和轉彎處。山上搭公車老人家多，這樣很危險", "display_name": "北投代表 No.31,345", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T07:16:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53507, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "我每天上班開車途經南港路、園區街，很驚訝台北市的馬路這麼坑坑疤疤，我彰化老家鄉間馬路都鋪得比台北好", "display_name": "南港代表 No.53,507", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T07:16:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 513, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "文化", "content": "臺北市需要讓更多市民朋友知道家中的舊物並非垃圾，勿輕易丟棄，對文化局而言這都是寶貴的歷史記憶。", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.513", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T07:16:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29265, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "體育", "content": "我想要有城市跑步專用道", "display_name": "大安代表 No.29,265", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T07:16:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13877, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "交通工具排碳量太高了！私人自用的交通工具太多了！", "display_name": "中山代表 No.13,877", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53507, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.53,507", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 513, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.513", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true